{"note":"run 707609b1-b6b4-45c0-9d50-ea102f60cbc5 (2026-11-05), prepare try 2: the stored story-director list (Haiku) + the take word timings; failed PRODUCTION_CHECK before the fix","title":"The Wolf Hunts Our Turtle","lengthSec":90,"card":{"mood":"funny","prop":"Grandma's roll of duct tape","price":"When your sticker hits zero, the soldiers carry you off to the wolf.","title":"The Blank Sticker","twist":"The wolf's order says soldiers take anyone whose sticker reads zero, so Nell tapes the word ZERO onto every soldier's helmet with grandma's duct tape, and the wolf's own army marches itself to the gate.","closer":"Everyone inside the turtle has a sticker now, and mine still says ZERO.","opener":"In this world, everyone inside a giant turtle has a shell-sticker, except me, and mine says ZERO.","teaser":"Her sticker says zero, and that is exactly the point.","formula":"F1","premise":"Our whole town lives inside a giant turtle, where each sticker counts down the days until the wolf's soldiers find you, and mine is blank.","setting":"inside something giant (an animal, a store, a tower)","examples":["Mrs. Pocket sneezed in the bakery, and her sticker dropped to nine.","Mr. Gorp hums on the stairs, so he has four days left.","The mailman delivers by shell-slide, always at a whisper."],"narrator":"Nell, the only kid with a blank sticker, which means the soldiers can't count her.","twistType":"T4"},"lines":[{"part":"rule","text":"In this world, everyone inside our giant turtle has a shell-sticker, except me."},{"part":"rule","text":"Mine says ZERO."},{"part":"tour","text":"You see, every sticker counts down the days."},{"part":"tour","text":"At zero, the wolf's soldiers carry you off to him."},{"part":"tour","text":"He's hunted our turtle for years."},{"part":"tour","text":"Mrs. Pocket sneezed in the bakery once."},{"part":"tour","text":"Her sticker dropped to nine."},{"part":"tour","text":"Now she sneezes into a pillow."},{"part":"tour","text":"Mr. Gorp hums on the stairs."},{"part":"tour","text":"He has four days left."},{"part":"tour","text":"Our mailman delivers by shell-slide."},{"part":"tour","text":"Always at a whisper."},{"part":"tour","text":"Last week he whispered a package into a pond."},{"part":"me","text":"I'm Nell, and I'm the exception."},{"part":"me","text":"My sticker's blank, so the soldiers can't count me."},{"part":"me","text":"I live with Grandma."},{"part":"me","text":"She fixes everything with duct tape."},{"part":"me","text":"That night she handed me a fresh roll."},{"part":"me","text":"Silver, with a little heart on it."},{"part":"me","text":"She said, \"Save it for something big.\""},{"part":"me","text":"I tucked it in my belt."},{"part":"until","text":"Until one night, the whole turtle shook."},{"part":"until","text":"Through the gate came the wolf's soldiers."},{"part":"until","text":"Square helmets. Shiny boots. Zero smiles."},{"part":"until","text":"They held up scanners. Beep. Beep."},{"part":"until","text":"Mr. Gorp's sticker hit zero. He'd hummed once too often."},{"part":"until","text":"They dragged him toward the dark tunnel."},{"part":"until","text":"Outside, two huge yellow eyes peeked over the wall."},{"part":"until","text":"Then the soldiers turned toward Grandma's house."},{"part":"discovery","text":"I hid behind a barrel and found the wolf's order."},{"part":"discovery","text":"A crumpled scroll with a big paw print."},{"part":"discovery","text":"Soldiers take anyone whose sticker reads zero."},{"part":"discovery","text":"They don't think. They read."},{"part":"discovery","text":"I looked at Grandma's duct tape."},{"part":"climax","text":"I tore off a strip of Grandma's duct tape and wrote ZERO."},{"part":"climax","text":"Then I ran."},{"part":"climax","text":"Slap slap slap, all down the line."},{"part":"climax","text":"The soldiers scanned each other."},{"part":"climax","text":"Beep. Zero. Beep. Zero."},{"part":"climax","text":"They dropped Mr. Gorp. He kept humming."},{"part":"climax","text":"Then the wolf stuck his giant nose through the gate."},{"part":"climax","text":"I jumped and slapped the last strip right on it."},{"part":"climax","text":"Beep. Zero."},{"part":"climax","text":"They picked him up like a sofa."},{"part":"climax","text":"Then they carried him off to the wolf."},{"part":"climax","text":"He's the wolf. It got confusing."},{"part":"closer","text":"The whole town cheered in the bakery."},{"part":"closer","text":"Grandma gave everyone a fresh sticker."},{"part":"closer","text":"Everyone inside the turtle has a sticker now."},{"part":"closer","text":"And mine still says ZERO."}],"director":{"provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","production":{"version":1,"summary":"","worlds":[{"id":"turtle_town","name":"the town","kind":"creature","base":"street","description":"","creature":{"species":"turtle","relation":"inside","heightM":60},"light":"day"}],"cast":[{"id":"nell","name":"","kind":"human","role":"narrator","look":"yellow raincoat, brown pigtails, freckles","job":""},{"id":"grandma","name":"","kind":"human","role":"elder","look":"grey bun, purple cardigan, round glasses","job":""},{"id":"mrs_pocket","name":"","kind":"human","role":"adult","look":"red apron, flour on cheeks, puffy hair","job":"baker"},{"id":"mr_gorp","name":"","kind":"human","role":"adult","look":"green hat, striped scarf, big moustache","job":""},{"id":"mailman","name":"","kind":"human","role":"adult","look":"blue cap, satchel, short grey beard","job":"mailman"}],"creatures":[{"id":"turtle","name":"","species":"turtle","look":"","scale":"colossal","heightM":60,"count":1,"behaviours":["stomp"],"monster":false},{"id":"wolf_king","name":"","species":"wolf","look":"","scale":"giant","heightM":40,"count":1,"behaviours":["reveal","reach","roar"],"monster":true}],"crowds":[{"id":"soldiers","name":"","member":"robot","of":"","count":12,"actions":["march","walk"]},{"id":"townsfolk","name":"","member":"person","of":"","count":30,"actions":["cheer"]}],"vehicles":[],"pro